"releaseNotes":"What’s new in Kin 2.0.2\n• Create your own advisor: give it a name and instructions, then edit, hide or delete it any time. If you had a custom advisor in Kin 1, it comes across with your import.\n• Type during a voice call: switch between Talk and Write without hanging up.\n• Reset memory: start your memory fresh from Settings.\n• Sign in with email and password, with two-step verification.\n• Daily Edge weather now uses your preferred temperature unit.\n• Better progress while your Kin 1 history imports.\n• Smarter conversations and many reliability fixes for reminders, notifications and chat.", "version":"2.0.2", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"Join 60,000+ people building their own board of AI advisors — specialists who remember you, connect the dots across your life, and help you think clearly.\n\nMost AI forgets you the moment you close it. Kin remembers. It builds a private, lasting picture of who you are — your goals, habits, energy, relationships and patterns — so every conversation and every day builds on the last.\n\nBUILD YOUR OWN BOARD\nChoose your specialists across work, body and energy, relationships, mind and meaning, social confidence and more. Add the advisors who fit your life, swap them anytime — and they all share one memory of you, so you never start from scratch.\n\nDAILY EDGE\nWake up to a personal briefing built from your day and your connected data, read to you by an advisor you choose. Start every morning clear on what matters.\n\nASK ANYTHING\nTired and don't know why? Stuck on a decision? Kin connects the dots across your sleep, habits and history to surface answers you couldn't see yourself.\n\nA JOURNAL THAT ANSWERS\nWrite it down and get more than a blank page. Talk through an entry with the right advisor, spot patterns, and actually understand yourself.\n\nREMEMBERS EVERYONE\nKin keeps track of the people in your life — who matters and what's going on — so you show up better in every conversation and relationship.\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\nYour life stays yours. Kin runs on zero-access architecture with on-device memory and a biometric lock. Your data is private and is never used to train anyone else's AI.\n\nWHY PEOPLE CHOOSE KIN\n- A board, not a bot: specialists with different expertise, one shared memory\n- Built on memory: key details remembered, and editable by you\n- Connects the dots across your whole life — work, health, relationships, energy, growth\n- Fast capture: voice notes, quick entries, searchable history\n- Private by design: on-device memory, biometric lock, zero-access\n\nWHAT YOU CAN DO WITH KIN\n- Start your day with Daily Edge, a briefing made just for you\n- Plan around clear priorities with calendar-aware prompts\n- Prep for tough conversations and debrief afterwards\n- Keep energy steady with check-ins and recovery nudges\n- Journal with AI guidance that feeds your memory automatically\n- Talk or type — switch anytime\n\nWhether you're building a company, navigating your career, or just living with more clarity, Kin is the personal AI that actually knows you.\n\nDownload Kin and start building your board today.\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nConnect with our team and get early access in Kin-community on Discord: https://discord.gg/e8bZaZdSQu", "bundleId":"ai.mykin.app", "minimumOsVersion":"17.0", "userRatingCount":187}, 
